title: Authorizations › Case page › History
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: The one 'History' at the bottom of every case page, closed until opened. Each line says who did it and carries one flag on the right: Agent, Decision, Logged decision or Scheduled. There is no separate 'Logged decisions' box any more.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the lines are the request's events in the store plus what was done on this page. Nothing is made up: a request with no events shows 'Nothing yet'. A line that is both a request event and a page action shows once.
---
screen pg "Case page, below the tab panel\n'History' with a one-line summary: '9 lines · 2 logged decisions'"
click h1 "Click 'History'\n(or Tab to it and press Enter or Space)"
process o1 "The section opens\nIt is a real button with aria-expanded"
decision d1 "Any lines?"
screen e0 "'Nothing yet'"
screen li "One list, newest first, planned steps on top\nEach line: a badge, the name, the time, the text, and a flag on the right"
click h2 "Click 'History' again"
process c1 "The section closes"

group gS "Where the lines come from"
  store s1 "The request's events in the store\nAgents: Reader, Verify, Scribe, Navigator\nThe payer: 'The payer approved the request'"
  store s2 "What you logged on this page\n'You dismissed ...', 'You added clinical context', 'You refined the recommendations', 'You sent ... a note', 'You edited the draft', 'You sent the draft back to Scribe'"
  store s3 "Agent work you started\n'Scribe applied Name the step-down provider'\n'Integrity read the draft again'"
  store s4 "Signing in New Case\n'You signed as Dr. Rivera (clinician) and sent the request'"
endgroup
process dup "Same line twice is shown once\nA dismissal the request repeats word for word\nThe request's 'You added clinical context' at the same minute\nThe request's 'Scribe added 6 items' when each applied card has its own line"

group gF "The flag on the right"
  process f1 "'Agent': a Psyflo agent did it"
  process f2 "'Decision': the payer answered\ngreen approved, amber in part or asked for more, red denied"
  process f3 "'Logged decision': you logged it on this page"
  process f4 "'Scheduled': planned, not done yet"
  process f5 "No flag: a person's action from elsewhere, e.g. the signature"
endgroup

pg --> h1 --> o1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| e0
d1 -->|Yes| li
li --> h2 --> c1
s1 --> dup
s2 --> dup
s3 --> dup
s4 --> dup
dup --> li
li --> f1 & f2 & f3 & f4 & f5
